content:
{
  "items": [
    {
      "i": 0,
      "text": "The new Discover Weekly algorithm is actually getting better at finding obscure indie tracks I love. It feels like a real DJ who knows my taste."
    },
    {
      "i": 1,
      "text": "Constantly losing connection in the car. Bluetooth drops every few minutes and I have to restart the app. Unacceptable for a premium service."
    },
    {
      "i": 2,
      "text": "Good music library, but the price hike was annoying. I'm staying for now because switching to Apple Music would mean losing all my saved playlists."
    },
    {
      "i": 3,
      "text": "Too many ads on the free tier even when I'm just browsing. It feels like they're trying to force me to pay up, which is frustrating."
    },
    {
      "i": 4,
      "text": "It's fine. The app is stable and the music is there, but nothing special. I use it mostly for podcasts now since the music recommendations are generic."
    },
    {
      "i": 5,
      "text": "Best streaming service hands down. The offline downloads work perfectly on my phone and the audio quality is crisp. I recommend it to everyone."
    },
    {
      "i": 6,
      "text": "I love the family plan. Sharing with my parents and siblings is easy and the cost per person is unbeatable. Great value for money."
    },
    {
      "i": 7,
      "text": "The UI changes are confusing. I can't find my favorite playlists anymore. It feels cluttered and less intuitive than it used to be."
    },
    {
      "i": 8,
      "text": "Spotify is essential for my daily commute. The seamless integration with my smart home and car makes it the only option I consider."
    },
    {
      "i": 9,
      "text": "Customer support is non-existent. I've been trying to fix a billing error for two weeks and only get automated replies. Very disappointed."
    },
    {
      "i": 10,
      "text": "Solid service. The podcast section is growing fast, which is nice. I just wish the shuffle feature would stop repeating songs so often."
    },
    {
      "i": 11,
      "text": "Absolutely love the lyric sync feature. It makes singing along so much better. The app is fast and rarely crashes. Highly recommend."
    },
    {
      "i": 12,
      "text": "Great catalog and the student discount is a lifesaver. I've been a promoter for years because it just works without major hiccups."
    },
    {
      "i": 13,
      "text": "The app crashed three times today while I was driving. Lost my playlist and had to restart. This is a safety issue, not just a bug."
    },
    {
      "i": 14,
      "text": "The new high-fidelity audio option is worth the upgrade. It sounds significantly better on my headphones. I'm a huge fan of the improvement."
    },
    {
      "i": 15,
      "text": "I miss the old interface. The new design is too busy and takes up too much screen space. It feels less premium than before."
    },
    {
      "i": 16,
      "text": "It's okay. I use it mostly for background music. The recommendations are hit or miss, but the library is comprehensive enough for my needs."
    },
    {
      "i": 17,
      "text": "Love the collaborative playlists with friends. It's a fun feature that keeps me engaged. The app is reliable and the music selection is vast."
    },
    {
      "i": 18,
      "text": "Decent service, but the ads on the free version are too intrusive. I'm considering switching to a competitor that offers a better free tier."
    },
    {
      "i": 19,
      "text": "The app is slow to load on my older phone. It takes forever to start playing music. I'm keeping it for now, but it's becoming a pain point."
    },
    {
      "i": 20,
      "text": "Worst experience ever. My account was locked for no reason and I can't get it back. No human support. I'm cancelling immediately."
    },
    {
      "i": 21,
      "text": "The price is too high for what you get. I feel like I'm paying for a service that constantly changes and breaks. Very unhappy with the value."
    },
    {
      "i": 22,
      "text": "Good overall. The music quality is great and the app is stable. I just wish the podcast section had more exclusive content to keep me subscribed."
    },
    {
      "i": 23,
      "text": "It's average. The recommendations are okay, but I often find myself searching for specific songs rather than using the auto-play feature."
    },
    {
      "i": 24,
      "text": "I like the app, but the battery drain is significant. My phone dies faster when Spotify is running in the background. Needs optimization."
    }
  ]
}
